  learned: "We could have built all of it for one event. Staging it is why it worked. The assumption was that an interactive venue needs wearables, so we tested the opposite: fifty tags stuck to walls, nothing distributed. It worked in a dark, dense, loud room with no extra load on staff, and that finding made everything after it cheap to deploy."
